# Signing material: keys, certificates, keystores, profiles. *.p8 covers App Store Connect API
# keys (AuthKey_<id>.p8) under any name. A backstop only: it does not untrack a committed file
# or stop `git add -f`, and the documented flows keep keys outside the repository.
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
saves/
backups/
山海弈旅程-*.json
萬象契旅程-*.json
# Mobile builds and archives (fastlane and Xcode outputs; signing material is ignored above)
build/
*.ipa
*.xcarchive
*.aab
*.apk
*.dSYM.zip
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/README.md
fastlane/test_output/
# Local Bundler settings and gems (CI installs its own via ruby/setup-ruby)
.bundle/
vendor/bundle/
